  },
  {
    "id": 1013004060040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "大丈夫よ、お店にいる人みんな\r\nお喋りに夢中みたいだし",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300406/1013004060040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004060050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……ちょうど、学校が終わったくらいの時間だもの\r\n『放課後』を満喫中ね",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300406/1013004060050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\nそれなら、大丈夫か……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004060060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ！\r\n私たちも『放課後』を満喫しましょう！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300406/1013004060060"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………はは……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004060070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……プロデューサー？\r\n何よ、今のそんなにおかしかった？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300406/1013004060070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや……すまん……！\r\n違うんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "放課後クライマックスガールズの『放課後』って、\r\n言葉そのままの意味っていうより",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『青春』の言い換えみたいなものだと\r\n俺は思うんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004060080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "…………！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300406/1013004060080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……やっぱり、そうだなって\r\n今、改めて感じたよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004060090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "…………！\r\n今……！？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300406/1013004060090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、今！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004060100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "…………ふふっ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300406/1013004060100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004060110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "プロデューサー、知ってる？\r\n私の地元の方だと『放課後』とは言わないのよ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300406/1013004060110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004060120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "『放課』っていうのは、授業と授業の間の\r\n休み時間のことを言って",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300406/1013004060120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004060130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "授業が全部終わった後のことを\r\n『放課後』っていう言い方はあまりしないの",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300406/1013004060130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へえ、そうなのか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004060140,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "だから『放課後』って聞くと、\r\nなんだか少し違和感があったんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300406/1013004060140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004060150,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "でも、プロデューサーが言うように\r\n私たちの『放課後』が、『青春』っていう意味だとしたら",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300406/1013004060150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004060160,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "すごく……しっくりくるかもしれないわ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300406/1013004060160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004060170,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私もまだまだ、『放課後』を\r\n満喫しないといけないわね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300406/1013004060170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004060180,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "もちろんプロデューサー、アナタもよ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300406/1013004060180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……おう！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
